WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.620
I've chased down every question

2
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.700
Read the books and followed every thread

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.520
But standing at the edge of all I know

4
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:31.960
I feel a deeper hunger in me

5
00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.240
There's a thirst that won't be satisfied

6
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:39.700
By everything the world has shown

7
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:46.700
We gather pearls of wisdom as we go

8
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.160
But the deepest truths remain unknown

9
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:56.080
We learn from what our senses tell us

10
00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.200
We trust the ones who came before

11
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:03.280
We reason through the darkness for a light

12
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.920
But something's calling out for more

13
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:12.180
Human minds have built cathedrals

14
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.880
Mapped the stars and split the atom wide

15
00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:19.140
But when I ask "Why am I here?"

16
00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:23.020
The world has never satisfied

17
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:28.840
Ever learning, never landing

18
00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:33.120
On the ground where certainty begins

19
00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:36.900
I've found the limits of my reach —

20
00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:39.860
Now I'm ready to look within

21
00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:46.700
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

22
00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:51.900
Walking toward the light that never dims

23
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:55.240
What the mind begins to question

24
00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.940
The spirit can complete

25
00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:02.900
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

26
00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:06.180
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

27
00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:12.120
How did all of this begin?

28
00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.700
Is there purpose in the change?

29
00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.920
Is someone guiding, watching, reaching down

30
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.840
To meet me where I am?

31
00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:25.140
I won't cling to fear of answers

32
00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:28.460
I won't hide behind my doubt

33
00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:32.440
Great wisdom leads to peace, I'm told

34
00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:37.760
And I'm ready to find out

35
00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:43.260
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

36
00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:48.640
Walking toward the light that never dims

37
00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.860
What the mind begins to question

38
00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:54.600
The spirit can complete

39
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:59.520
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

40
00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:02.760
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

41
00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.840
I am more than flesh and reasoning

42
00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.540
There's a spirit living here inside

43
00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:16.600
When I reached beyond what I could prove

44
00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:21.680
That's when God became real to me

45
00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:24.820
The questions didn't disappear

46
00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:28.460
But fear gave way to hope

47
00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.500
In the stillness something spoke to me:

48
00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.600
"You were never searching alone"

49
00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:43.120
This is when God becomes real —

50
00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:51.500
Not a theory, but a voice you feel

51
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:56.560
Faith and learning, companions in the same cause

52
00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.920
Walking toward the light that never dims

53
00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.200
What the mind begins to question

54
00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.920
The spirit can complete

55
00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:12.920
Truth is knowable — God is not silent

56
00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.240
He's waiting at the edge of all we seek

57
00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:24.140
So if you're standing where I stood

58
00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:29.840
Hungry, searching, wondering if it's real

59
00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:37.220
Ask Him — just speak what's in your heart

60
00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.580
He has answered me

61
00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.200
He will answer you

62
00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.980
Truth is knowable

63
00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:51.980
Peace can be found

64
00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.500
This I promise

65
00:04:55.500 --> 00:05:00.620
In the name of Jesus Christ

66
00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.680
Amen.
